Now I have finished all the episodes in the first season, Im here to change my reviews and draw my final conclution:
10 out of 10!! for sure!! this is the rating from a fan of the whole Hitman franchise, this is THE best hitman game and probably THE best assassination game I personally have ever played, it defines the art, and it defines you, both the hardcore gamers and the attitude of the developer.
In the first season, you have best designed locations with massive and deeply meaningful details everywhere in each location; you have the most realistic yet very artistic construction and environment visual design; And of course, the musics and sound effects are also well placed which hit you in the right place and in the right time; The subtle storyline is invisible in each episode, but linked every mission seamlessly, very intriguing through out the game.
Suggestions for season 2:
1, I understand suit case has its difficulties to be included everywhere and freely carried by 47, but I still encourage you to add it into the game in an immersive way;
2, A "sniping pose" as shown in the trailer by 47 who was sitting under that CASIO sign can also be included whenever 47 carrying a sniper rifle, I believe this is a great idea yet it doesn't hurt the current gameplay;
3, Weapon customization ;
4, The current loadout choosing UI functions well but any chance to make that more epic or immersive? like to give 47 some secret hideout like the BAT CAVE , that would be awesome.
5, I personally want to reduce the fov a bit, if there can be an option to scroll the camera to some extent, would be equally awesome.
6. More elusive targets

